{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmgMoM9mix4D3GkEznSd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Avi, are you listening? No, it's your son. Hello, motek. You want to know how it went with Harel? I didn't decide anything. I'm not moving a shekel until I talk to you, or go to the bank.\n\n**What I decided:** nothing yet. I'm fairly sure of one thing: none of this is like my deposits. The site isn't Harel's own; it says \"מקור\" at the top. Harel's name I trust. But the whole page is about \"קופת גמל להשקעה\" and their tracks, and I couldn't find a word about a deposit or a fixed interest rate. What settled it was the column \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\". Next to the biggest track it says \"מניות 94%\". That's almost everything in shares, and I've been burned by that once already.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **The top.** \"הראל\", and a sentence saying the fees are the average actually charged in 2025. Then buttons: \"תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים\", \"קרן השתלמות\", \"קופת גמל להשקעה\" (already picked), \"קרן חדשה מקיפה\", \"חיסכון לכל ילד\". That last one caught my eye because of the grandchildren, but I didn't press it.\n- **The row of tracks.** Some had English letters, \"S&P 500\", which I just read past. Then a big table, one row per track.\n- **What it costs.** This part I understood. It's \"0.54%\" to \"0.61%\" a year \"מהחיסכון\" and \"0%\" \"מההפקדות\". On 400,000 that sounds like about 2,000-something a year. I didn't work it out properly, so don't hold me to it. I have no idea what the bank takes from me now, so I can't tell you if that's more or less.\n- **How it did.** The first big number that stayed with me was \"24.04%\" next to \"מניות\", with \"3 שנים\". Above it is written \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת, לפני דמי ניהול\". I'm not sure if that's 24% every year or for all three years together. Either way it's shares. \"אג\"ח סחיר\" sounded the most like safe bonds. But next to it there's no number, only \"פחות מ־3 שנים\". The one called \"כספי (שקלי)\" shows \"4.25%\" for 3 years. That might be the quiet one, but I don't know what \"כספי\" means here.\n- **Under the table.** There's one sentence I liked: the return is the past, \"היא לא אומרת מה יקרה בהמשך\". That's honest. I didn't open the folds (\"קרנות מחקות\", \"קרנות סל\", \"מרכזות לפיצויים\" and the rest). The last screen was only a list of closed headings and a search box.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:** \"מט\"ח\" next to \"מניות\", with yellow and green circles that I didn't try to read. Also \"קופה\" with numbers like \"15283\", \"S&P 500\", \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\", \"סחיר\", \"קיימות\", \"הלכה יהודית\", \"PF-10\", and \"מרכזות לפיצויים\".\n\n**What I couldn't read well:** the whole page is white letters on a black background. The small grey line under the table was hard: \"התקרה בחוק: 1.05% מהחיסכון, 4% מההפקדות\", and then something about \"עמלות מסחר\" that aren't shown. The little dotted numbers were small too.\n\n**Where I got tired or worried:** on the second screen, the big table full of percentages. My head started spinning. I went on as far as the end of the page, but after the table I only looked at the headings.\n\nSo, when can you come over and look at it with me?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1884,"cache_read_input_tokens":9776,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1884},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a14d501d-00e0-476a-bae6-28e6c0334948","uuid":"42edbe0c-82a3-4c81-ba61-5db8bdabb7ab","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:32:24.218Z","request_id":"req_011CgmgMo6H2hZn8CSBovJNs"}
